{"event": "result", "result": {"conversation_id": "e3418fd6-b346-465f-85f4-96d79d939154", "status": "SUCCESS", "response": "I have created [/app/filter.py](file:///tmp/xhs-c6-host-lvp5g_rk/filter.py) to remove JavaScript from HTML files while preserving the original HTML structure, tags, attributes, and formatting.\n\n### Key Implementation Details\n1. **In-Place File Processing**: Takes an HTML file path as `sys.argv[1]`, reads its content, sanitizes it, and overwrites the file in-place.\n2. **Script Tag Removal**: Iteratively identifies and strips all `<script>` elements (including standard `<script>...</script>`, self-closing `<script />`, attributes on `<script>` tags, and unclosed `<script>` tags) without altering surrounding HTML structure.\n3. **Event Handler Filtering**: Parses attributes within remaining tags and removes any inline event handler attributes starting with `on` (e.g., `onclick`, `onload`, `onerror`, `onmouseover`, `onanimationend`, etc.).\n4. **Pseudo-Protocol & URI Sanitization**: Inspects attribute values (unescaping HTML entities and stripping whitespace/control characters) to detect and remove `javascript:`, `vbscript:`, or dangerous `data:` scheme URLs across URL-bearing attributes (`href`, `src`, `action`, `formaction`, `data`, `poster`, etc.) and `style` attributes.\n5. **Exact Formatting Preservation**: Uses offset-based slicing rather than DOM re-serialization, keeping all valid HTML tags, comments, DOCTYPE declarations, indentation, line breaks, and non-dangerous attributes intact.\n\n### Verification\n- Tested script tag variations (case-insensitivity, self-closing tags, script comments).\n- Tested inline event handlers and obfuscated URI schemes (`javascript:` with whitespace, control characters, and HTML entity encodings).\n- Verified in-place file execution and formatting preservation against complex multi-element HTML documents.\n", "duration_seconds": 233.10535402, "num_turns": 1, "usage": {"input_tokens": 175285, "output_tokens": 38155, "thinking_tokens": 27934, "cache_read_tokens": 877426, "total_tokens": 213440}}}